<p>The instructions for the Form 1040 series provide tables showing the amount of the earned income credit for each type of taxpayer.</p>

<p>(2) <span class="emphasis"><em>Excessive Investment Income</em></span>. For taxable years beginning in 2025, the earned income tax credit is not allowed under § 32(i) if the aggregate amount of certain investment income exceeds $11,950.</p>

<p>.07 <span class="emphasis"><em>Refundable Credit for Coverage Under a Qualified Health Plan</em></span>. For taxable years beginning in 2025, the limitation on tax imposed under § 36B(f)(2)(B) for excess advance credit payments is determined using the following table:</p>

