			<th align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;"><span class="emphasis"><em>Phase-in range amount</em></span></th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">Married Individuals Filing Joint Returns</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">$394,600</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$494,600</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">Married Individuals Filing Separate Returns</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">$197,300</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$247,300</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid ; ">All Other Returns</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-right: 1px solid ; ">$197,300</td>
			<td align="center" style>$247,300</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
&nbsp;

<p>.28 <span class="emphasis"><em>Eligible Long-Term Care Premiums</em></span>. For taxable years beginning in 2025, the limitations under § 213(d)(10), regarding eligible long-term care premiums includible in the term “medical care”, as adjusted for inflation, are as follows:</p>

<div class="table"><a name="idm140207731107536"></a>

<p class="title"></p>

<div class="table-contents">
<table class="table table-condensed" style="border-collapse: collapse !important;border-top: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; border-left: 1px solid !important; border-right: 1px solid !important; " summary>
	<colgroup>
		<col class="col1">
		<col class="col2">
	</colgroup>
	<thead>
		<tr>
			<th align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid ; border-bottom: 1px solid ; "><span class="emphasis"><em>Attained Age Before the Close of the Taxable Year</em></span></th>
			<th align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;"><span class="emphasis"><em>Limitation on Premiums</em></span></th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">40 or less</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$480</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">More than 40 but not more than 50</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$900</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">More than 50 but not more than 60</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$1,800</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">More than 60 but not more than 70</td>
			<td align="center" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">$4,810</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid ; ">More than 70</td>
			<td align="center" style>$6,020</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</div>
