<p>.56 <span class="emphasis"><em>Failure to File Partnership Return</em></span>. In the case of any return required to be filed in 2026, the dollar amount used to determine the amount of the penalty under § 6698(b)(1) is $255.</p>

<p>.57 <span class="emphasis"><em>Failure to File S Corporation Return</em></span>. In the case of any return required to be filed in 2026, the dollar amount used to determine the amount of the penalty under § 6699(b)(1) is $255.</p>

<p>.58 <span class="emphasis"><em>Failure to File Correct Information Returns</em></span>. In the case of any failure relating to a return required to be filed in 2026, the penalty amounts under § 6721 are:</p>

<p>(1) for persons with average annual gross receipts for the most recent three taxable years of more than $5,000,000, for failure to file correct information returns:</p>

<div class="table"><a name="idm140207730970144"></a>

<p class="title"></p>

<div class="table-contents">
<table class="table table-condensed" style="border-collapse: collapse !important;border-top: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; border-left: 1px solid !important; border-right: 1px solid !important; " summary>
	<colgroup>
		<col class="col1">
		<col class="col2">
		<col class="col3">
	</colgroup>
	<thead>
		<tr>
			<th align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid ; border-bottom: 1px solid ; ">Scenario</th>
			<th align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid ; border-bottom: 1px solid ; ">Penalty Per Return</th>
			<th align="left" style="border-bottom: 1px solid !important;">Calendar Year Maximum</th>
		</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td align="left" style="border-right: 1px solid !important; border-bottom: 1px solid !important; ">General Rule (§ 6721(a)(1))</td>
